@page "/betting-101"

<div class="app-card">
    <div class="app-card-header" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669) !important;">
        <h2>🎓 Sports Betting 101</h2>
        <p>Learn how to beat the sportsbooks</p>
    </div>

    <div class="app-card-body">
        
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px;">
            The key to profitable sports betting is removing emotion and replacing it with <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">math and logic</strong>.
        </p>

        <!-- Bankroll Management -->
        <div class="info-section">
            <div class="info-header">
                <span class="info-icon" style="background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15); color: #3b82f6;">💰</span>
                <h3 class="info-title">Bankroll Management</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="info-list">
                <li>
                    <strong>The 1-3% Rule:</strong> Never bet more than 1-3% of your total bankroll on a single game.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Standardize Units:</strong> Define a "Unit" (e.g., $10) and calculate profit in units, not dollars.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong style="color:var(--danger)">Don't Chase:</strong> Increasing your bet size to "get even" after a loss is the fastest way to go broke.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Expected Value -->
        <div class="info-section">
            <div class="info-header">
                <span class="info-icon" style="background: rgba(168,85,247,0.15); color: #a855f7;">📈</span>
                <h3 class="info-title">Positive Expected Value (EV+)</h3>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">
                EV betting is when our model's <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">probability of winning</strong> is higher than the <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">implied probability</strong> of the sportsbook's odds.
            </p>
            <div class="formula-box">
                (Win Prob * Payout) - (Loss Prob * Stake)
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic;">
                If the result is positive, it's a "math win" over the long term. Our ML engines find these!
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Understanding Odds -->
        <div class="info-section">
            <div class="info-header">
                <span class="info-icon" style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color: #f59e0b;">📊</span>
                <h3 class="info-title">Understanding Odds</h3>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">
                American Odds are just probabilities in disguise.
            </p>
            <div class="odds-grid">
                <div class="odds-box">
                    <span class="odds-lbl">Odds</span>
                    <span class="odds-val">-110</span>
                </div>
                <div class="odds-box">
                    <span class="odds-lbl">Meaning</span>
                    <span class="odds-val mt">Bet $110 to win $100</span>
                </div>
                <div class="odds-box">
                    <span class="odds-lbl">Implied %</span>
                    <span class="odds-val mt">52.4%</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="odds-grid" style="margin-top: 8px;">
                 <div class="odds-box">
                    <span class="odds-val">+150</span>
                </div>
                <div class="odds-box">
                    <span class="odds-val">Bet $100 to win $150</span>
                </div>
                <div class="odds-box">
                    <span class="odds-val">40.0%</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- The Kelly Criterion -->
        <div class="info-section">
            <div class="info-header">
                <span class="info-icon" style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); color: #10b981;">⚖️</span>
                <h3 class="info-title">The Kelly Criterion</h3>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">
                A mathematical formula used to determine the optimal amount of your bankroll to bet based on your edge.
            </p>
            <div class="quote-box">
                "Bet more when the edge is high, bet less when the edge is low."
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pro Tips -->
        <div class="pro-tips">
            <h4 class="tips-title">⚡ Pro Tips</h4>
            <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size:14px;">Line Shopping</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top:2px;">Getting FanDuel at -105 vs DraftKings at -110 makes a massive difference over 1,000 bets.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size:14px;">Avoid the "Parlay Trap"</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top:2px;">Parlays are highly profitable for books. Use them sparingly.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <strong style="color:var(--text-primary); font-size:14px;">Trust the Data</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top:2px;">If the Neural Network and XGBoost agree, it's a high-conviction signal.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .info-section { background: var(--surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .info-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); padding-bottom: 8px;}
    .info-icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; }
    .info-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0;}
    
    .info-list { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;}
    .info-list li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .info-list li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .formula-box { background: rgba(168,85,247,0.1); border: 1px dashed rgba(168,85,247,0.3); padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; color: #c084fc; font-family: 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;}
    .quote-box { background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1); border-left: 3px solid #10b981; padding: 10px 14px; font-style: italic; color: #34d399; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }

    .odds-grid { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .odds-box { flex: 1; background: var(--surface-overlay); padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border-light); text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; height: 44px;}
    .odds-lbl { display: block; font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 2px;}
    .odds-val { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); }
    .odds-val.mt { margin-top: auto; margin-bottom: auto;}

    .pro-tips { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.2); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .tips-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;}
</style>
